---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import ZoomImage from '../components/ZoomImage.astro';

import walk1Image from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1.jpeg';
import walk1Image1 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-1.jpg';
import walk1Image2 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-2.jpg';
import walk1Image3 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-3.jpg';
import walk1Image4 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-4.jpg';
import walk1Image5 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-5.jpg';
import walk1Image6 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-6.jpg';
import walk1Image7 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-7.jpg';
import walk1Image8 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-8.jpg';
import walk1Image9 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-9.jpg';
import walk1Image10 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-10.jpg';
import walk1Image11 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-11.jpg';
import walk1Image12 from '../assets/walk-images/walk-1-12.jpg';

import walk2Image from '../assets/walk-images/walk-2.jpeg';
import walk3Image from '../assets/walk-images/walk-3.jpeg';
import walk4Image from '../assets/walk-images/walk-4.jpeg';
import walk5Image from '../assets/walk-images/walk-5.jpeg';
import walk6Image from '../assets/walk-images/walk-6.jpeg';
import walk7Image from '../assets/walk-images/walk-7.jpeg';
import walk8Image from '../assets/walk-images/walk-8.jpeg';

const mapImageSize = '400';

// TODO add pages for fun stuff
---

<Layout>
	<Section>
		<p>
            In NYC, there's an annual event called the <a href="https://shorewalkers.org/great-saunter/" target="_blank">Great Saunter</a>, in which people walk around the entire perimeter of Manhattan, about 32 miles, in a single day. I loved the idea when I heard about it, but there's no way I would be able to do it in one day, or at least enjoy doing it. So! I decided to do it in parts - about 4 miles at a time, over the course of several weekends.
        </p>
        <h2>First Section (Sept 15th, 2024)</h2>
        <p class="map-image">
            <Image src={walk1Image} alt="Map of Manhattan with a line going from Battery Park to 14th Street along the west side" width={mapImageSize} />
        </p>
        <p>
            I started at the Staten Island Ferry Terminal, and ended the first day at Pier 57 (approximately 14th Street). This is an area I've spent a lot of time around already, but there was a lot I hadn't seen (or at least, noticed) before!
        </p>
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image1} alt="Test" id="walk-1-1" />
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image2} alt="Test" id="walk-1-2" />
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image3} alt="Test" id="walk-1-3" />
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image4} alt="Test" id="walk-1-4" />
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image5} alt="Test" id="walk-1-5" />
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image6} alt="Test" id="walk-1-6" />
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image7} alt="Test" id="walk-1-7" />
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image8} alt="Test" id="walk-1-8" />
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image9} alt="Test" id="walk-1-9" />
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image10} alt="Test" id="walk-1-10" />
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image11} alt="Test" id="walk-1-11" />
        <ZoomImage src={walk1Image12} alt="Test" id="walk-1-12" />
        <h2>Second Section (Sept 22nd, 2024)</h2>
        <p class="map-image">
            <Image src={walk2Image} alt="Map of Manhattan with a line going from 14th Street to 72nd Street on the west side" width={mapImageSize} />
        </p>
        <p>TK</p>
        <h2>Third Section (Sept 29th, 2024)</h2>
        <p class="map-image">
            <Image src={walk3Image} alt="Map of Manhattan with a line going from 72nd Street to 125th Street on the west side" width={mapImageSize} />
        </p>
        <p>TK</p>
        <h2>Fourth Section (Oct 6th, 2024)</h2>
        <p class="map-image">
            <Image src={walk4Image} alt="Map of Manhattan with a line going from 125th Street to Dyckman Street on the west side" width={mapImageSize} />
        </p>
        <p>TK</p>
        <h2>Fifth Section (May 3rd, 2025)</h2>
        <p class="map-image">
            <Image src={walk5Image} alt="Map of Manhattan with a line going from Dyckman Street on the west side around the top of the island and to 155th Street on the east side" width={mapImageSize} />
        </p>
        <p>TK</p>
        <h2>Sixth Section (May 11th, 2025)</h2>
        <p class="map-image">
            <Image src={walk6Image} alt="Map of Manhattan with a line going from 155th Street to 96th Street on the east side" width={mapImageSize} />
        </p>
        <p>TK</p>
        <h2>Seventh Section (May 25th, 2025)</h2>
        <p class="map-image">
            <Image src={walk7Image} alt="Map of Manhattan with a line going from 96th Street to 35th Street on the east side" width={mapImageSize} />
        </p>
        <p>TK</p>
        <h2>Last Section (June 8th, 2025)</h2>
        <p class="map-image">
            <Image src={walk8Image} alt="Map of Manhattan with a line going from 35th Street to Battery Park on the east side" width={mapImageSize} />
        </p>
        <p>TK</p>
	</Section>
</Layout>

<style lang="scss">
.map-image {
    text-align: center;
}
</style>
